0..75 Comment "// The twin of `model/desc/relative-monad.gandr`: associativity, whose left"
76..151 Comment "// side overlaps itself while its right side substitutes under a binder, so"
152..216 Comment "// it waits on critical pairs between second-order rules (#2116,"
217..263 Comment "// `second-order-rules.gandr`\'s `LetOverlap`)."
265..336 Comment "/// Associativity: extending an extension is extending by the composite"
337..414 Comment "/// continuation. The inner `ext(m, k)` is an instance of the rule\'s own left"
415..490 Comment "/// side, and the rule instantiates `k` under `bind x .`, so the overlap is"
491..538 Comment "/// refused until such a pair can join (#2116)."
